         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Sun Tzu and Learning\n\nIn our lives we are always learning, every day. Sometimes we learn from good experiences; other times we learn from bad experiences that happened to us or to other people. War is one example of this kind of experience.\n\nIn this class, we are going to learn how to create strategies for learning based on plans and self-understanding, so that we can improve our lives.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
