         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Who Was Sun Tzu?\n\nSun Tzu (孙子) was the Chinese author of the classic *The Art of War* (*Bingfa* — 兵法). Although his book focuses on war, it is completely possible to extract lessons from it to fight ignorance — and not other people.\n\nWe are going to start by using the 5 factors he teaches at the beginning of his book.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "f5abbb38-1a83-41c0-a9ac-3f8925220782",
         "prev": "64f63405-fa64-459a-a210-dca861aabfaa",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
