               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=867d9985-b757-472a-8197-386486ec58d6",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Conclusion\n\nIn this class we learned that the factors defined by Sun Tzu (孙子) can be understood not only in our daily lives, but also in our family, at work and in other areas of our lives.\n\nThese factors help us to organize our time and our lives.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
